entityDescription:
Association "Technological institute of aquaculture” is a Bulgarian organization established with the aims to improve the efficiency and profitability of Bulgarian aquaculture; to achieve a high specialization of expertise in the field of aquaculture; to provide support for development of recirculation systems in aquaculture; to form proactive, institutional research and experimental development policy aquaculture; to assist the Bulgarian state in the development and implementation of policies for security of human resources, to achieve and guarantee professionalism experts working in the field of aquaculture; to initiate, carry out and / or support research in aquaculture; to share experience with other countries member states of the union, and with neighboring countries to implement best practices and technologies in the field; aquaculture enhancement of biodiversity and protecting the environment; to develop and implement policies for encouraging the participation of SMEs as a beneficiary of programmes and funds; to ensure the provision of appropriate expert and professional support to Bulgarian aquaculture, to introduce policies and laws fostering the development of fisheries industry in Bulgaria; to stimulate biodiversity and the environment.

For achieving the set goals of the Association will carry out the following activities:
 development and / or promotion of cutting edge technologies for farming of fish;

 promoting and furthering of selective breeding in order to identify ways to improve the acceptance and adoption of comprehensive selection methods for breeding in Bulgarian aquaculture;

 establishment and membership in international organizations and in associations whose activities are related to the association;

 integration of modern scientific approaches and technologies in Bulgarian aquaculture;

 dissemination of information networking and exchange of information between manufacturers of equipment for aquaculture and other interested parties;

 enhancing professional competence and skills by building administrative capacity, including a phase of educational development in the field of aquaculture;

 capacity building for group operations and management, aqua-business skills, management of fish farms, added value and marketing of aquaculture products;

 providing technical assistance to state institutions, municipalities and traders for working under financing programs and plans;

 capacity building of fish farms, and raising awareness on aquaculture development, to help the sector;
 provide qualified assistance to states and regional institutions, municipalities and companies in the development of projects to apply for funding programs;

 marketing of aquaculture purposes of research, testing or development that is not for profit;

 issuing manuals and information materials, disseminating practices and expertise and build methods for interactive exchange of information between all institutions, active in the field of fish farming and aquaculture;

 implementing measures to encourage environmental conservation of threatened fish species.

Association "Technological Institute of Aquaculture" offers the following services to end customers, corporate investors and individuals:

 Consulting services;
 Project Management;
 Implementation of projects

Association "Technological Institute of Aquaculture" has started three major projects in Bulgaria:
 Establishment of a center in Krapchene, Montana for preservation of four fish species - endangered from extinction;

 Laboratory in Blagoevgrad which will study and develop methods for reproduction of different fish species from the region;

 Establishment of an indoor farm with RAS for two fresh water fish species

